<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  THE PRIVACY MANIFEST, because App Store Connect refuses an upload that
  calls a "required reason" API without declaring why (ITMS-91053, enforced
  since May 2024 — TestFlight included). Two of those APIs are in this app:

    UserDefaults     @AppStorage in ExchangeView / ParcelMapView, and
                     DashboardBlock's UserDefaults.standard — the farmer's
                     own layout preferences, read and written by this app
                     and nothing else.                          → CA92.1
    File timestamp   ResponseCache reads .modificationDate /
                     .contentModificationDateKey of its OWN files under
                     Caches/ResponseCache, to show the age of cached data
                     and to evict oldest-first.                 → C617.1

  Everything else Apple lists (system boot time, disk space, active
  keyboards) was searched for on 2026-10-01 and is not called. `.fileSizeKey`
  is a file's size, not the volume's free space, so it is not "disk space".

  A NEW CALL TO ONE OF THOSE APIs NEEDS A NEW ENTRY HERE, or the next upload
  is refused. The list of categories and reasons is Apple's:
  https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy-manifest-files/describing-use-of-required-reason-api

  COLLECTED DATA describes what leaves the device, never used for tracking,
  and no tracking domains. Sent to app.agrent.bg for the app to function and
  linked to the user, except the three diagnostics types at the end.

    User ID          the signed-in account's identifier.
    Email Address    Sign in with Apple asks for the `.email` scope, and the
                     address reaches the server inside Apple's identity
                     token (AuthClient, AppleSignIn).
    Photos or Videos the account picture, chosen in Профил and uploaded as
                     a 256×256 JPEG (AccountPicture, #333/#344, 2026-10-16).
                     Nothing else from the photo library leaves the phone.
    Other User Content
                     the farm records the user enters (journal, tasks,
                     costs, parcels) and Борса listings and messages.
    Product Interaction
                     which screens open and which key actions are done
                     (#493, UsageEvents), for the usage page, PURPOSE
                     ANALYTICS. Names from a closed list only: no record id,
                     crop, parcel, position or typed text. Recorded only
                     while the server's `usage.events` flag is on; kept 90
                     days by the server.

  And to Sentry, the one third-party SDK (#494, owner 2026-11-01), NOT
  linked to the user: no user, IP, device name, screenshot, request or
  address goes with them (CrashReporting). Sentry's own manifest, inside
  its framework, declares the same three. Sent only from a build that
  carries the DSN, which is TestFlight's and the App Store's.

    Crash Data       crash reports and their stack traces.
    Performance Data freezes (2 s and longer), app start and screen render
                     times, a 2% sample of slow screens.
    Other Diagnostic Data
                     Apple's MetricKit diagnostics (hangs, CPU and disk
                     exceptions) and the device model and iOS version each
                     report carries.

  Location (#671, owner 2026-11-17): Табло's weather and rainfall are for
  where the phone is, ROUNDED TO ABOUT 5 KM (0.05°, at most two decimals)
  before it leaves the device, and sent to Apple Weather and Open-Meteo.
  App Functionality, not linked, not tracking. DECLARED AS PRECISE by the
  owner's choice (2026-11-26), matching App Store Connect's answer: what is
  sent is coarse, and declaring more than is sent is the safe direction. The precise position still never leaves the phone:
  the map dot and the parcel «Нов запис» ticks are worked out on the device
  (#492). PrivacyManifestTests keeps the readers to the map files and to
  WeatherPlace.swift, the one file that rounds and hands the value on.

  This must agree with the "App Privacy" answers in App Store Connect,
  which the owner keeps. A new kind of data leaving the phone needs an
  entry here AND an answer there before the next upload.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSPrivacyTracking</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSPrivacyTrackingDomains</key>
	<array/>
	<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePreciseLocation</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeUserID</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeEmailAddress</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePhotosorVideos</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeAudioData</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherUserContent</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeCrashData</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePerformanceData</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeOtherDiagnosticData</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAppFunctionality</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeProductInteraction</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeLinked</key>
			<true/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypeTracking</key>
			<false/>
			<key>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposes</key>
			<array>
				<string>NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypePurposeAnalytics</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>CA92.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
			<string>NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp</string>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypeReasons</key>
			<array>
				<string>C617.1</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
